      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>The Prime Wardens version of Haka has a power which states: &quot;Play a card. &nbsp;If that card has &quot;Haka&quot; in the title, you may apply its effects to a target other than Haka.&quot;</p><p>What exactly does &quot;its effects&quot; refer to? &nbsp;Does it refer to the entire text of the card, or only the part of the card which happens after the drawing/discarding?</p><p>In other words, if Haka wanted to use his power to play Haka of Restoration to heal up Fanatic, does Haka draw 2 cards and then discard 1 or more cards so that Fanatic regains health, or does Fanatic draw 2 cards and discard 1 or more cards to regain health?</p>",
